        data['${effectivePrefix}extraction_timestamp'],
      ),
      supportingEvidenceIds: attachedDatabase.typeMapping.read(
        DriftSqlType.string,
        data['${effectivePrefix}supporting_evidence_ids'],
      ),
      history: attachedDatabase.typeMapping.read(
        DriftSqlType.string,
        data['${effectivePrefix}history'],
      ),
    );
  }

  @override
  $TransactionTableTable createAlias(String alias) {
    return $TransactionTableTable(attachedDatabase, alias);
  }
}

class TransactionData extends DataClass implements Insertable<TransactionData> {
  final String id;
  final DateTime createdAt;
  final DateTime updatedAt;
  final int version;
  final bool isDeleted;
  final DateTime? deletedAt;

  /// pending, synced, error, local_only
  final String syncStatus;

  /// cloud_provider, onedrive_local, health_connect, etc.
  final String? sourceProvider;

  /// The unique ID from the source provider (e.g., file path, API ID).
  final String? sourceIdentifier;

  /// hash of the content for duplicate detection.
  final String? contentHash;
  final String? deviceId;

  /// Logical ID for versioning. PK is inherited 'id'.
  final String transactionId;
  final bool isLatest;

  /// Foreign key to the account.
  final String accountId;

  /// Date of the transaction.
  final DateTime transactionDate;

  /// amount in currency subunits (if using int) or double.
  final double amount;

  /// income, expense, transfer.
  final String type;

  /// Auto-categorized label (Food, Rent, etc.)
  final String category;

  /// Normalized fields
  final String merchant;
  final String institution;

  /// Raw description from statement.
  final String description;

  /// Payment method (UPI, Debit Card, etc.)
  final String? paymentMethod;

  /// Unique hash of (date, amount, description) for deduplication.
  final String dedupeHash;

  /// Reference to the source import.
  final String? sourceImportId;
  final String? originProviderId;
  final String? originResourceId;
  final String? originThreadId;
  final String? syncBatchId;
  final double? confidenceScore;
  final String? confidenceReason;
  final String verificationState;
  final String? originalEmailLink;
  final String? parserVersion;
  final DateTime? extractionTimestamp;

  /// JSON list of FinanceExtraction IDs.
  final String? supportingEvidenceIds;

  /// JSON audit trail of merges and corrections.
  final String? history;
